%%% note
由来: mulet test/mulet/mime_test.clj:12 (fromString-test)
testing: Parse MIME type with parameters
元の形: mime/fromString の直接呼び出しを DW に書き換え
mulet: 成功
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import fromString from dw::module::Mime
output application/json
---
fromString("text/plain; charset=UTF-8")
%%% output application/json
{
  "success": true,
  "result": {
    "type": "text",
    "subtype": "plain",
    "parameters": {
      "charset": "UTF-8"
    }
  }
}
